   "marks": 3,
   "text": "On one day, 400 players attempt Level 12 for the first time. Find the probability that a randomly chosen player wins a silver badge, and hence find the expected number of these 400 players who win a silver badge. (3)",
   "command": "find",
   "forms": [],
