   "marks": 4,
   "text": "After an update to Level 12, the developer thinks that first-attempt times have got shorter on average. A random sample of 25 new players gives a mean first-attempt time of 80.2 seconds. Assume that times are still normally distributed with standard deviation 11 seconds. Test, at the 5% significance level, whether this sample supports the developer's belief. Write your hypotheses in terms of $\\mu$, the mean first-attempt time in seconds after the update. (4)",
